      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "You do know playspace mover is a SteamVR modification and not a VRChat modification. With playspace, the nameplate doesn't move up or down with them while modified clients with no clip just stay floating and never fall down with their nameplates following them.\nWhen in public worlds, best to avoid crashing is just hide avatars in safety settings menu except friends (it's up to you, but is recommended in public worlds)\nBeing a streamer and someone saying racial slurs is nothing new and is easy mute em or block them.\nDDoSing has been a problem for a while now and not sure if VRChat will resolve it because we always get the generic \"get a VPN\" speech which doesn't help at all for those who can't afford to use one that actually hides your real IP and reasonable bandwidth usage for the services.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
