      "value": "@{5af8fc26a97e4b511e461b1d|full_name}: Agree. VPN should not be needed for security like that. Any games that reveal IP's have bad security and they should fix it without excuses. Anything else is just bad devs.\nI am aware of the IP leak though and use VPN myself cause of it. But that doesnt change how bad it is from a developer standpoint to not secure that. No excuse can make that good.",
