      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5a4169d823f6da7b8133d860|full_name}: DDoSing has prevented people from wanting to join this game again and pretty sad seeing new players join just to see them leave and say they are not coming back to the game.\nExplains why i don't come on as often as the issue has never been resolved and seems like the devs are more interested in adding more features than fixing the current problems, which is trusting the client side completely and never checking anything server side like vote kicks and moderation kicks and warnings from the world/instance owners, which usually falls within good reason to do so.",
      "viewerReactions": null
