      "value": "Sorry I'm new here. I left this game for a long time because of the crashing that was practically destroying my graphics card. I usually play on my bfs computer. I want to say get rid of the Nutorious mod. It’s a common client people pay to use. Squeakers and toxic people think it’s funny to use, bully, and intimidate other players. They need to get rid of it! It very frustrating and annoying.",
