      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I refuse to go to public instances because every time I do I crash. I've had times where vrchat took my whole computer with it. My computer is pretty powerful, but still has issues with public worlds. I know it's not the avatars people are wearing either, especially when I'm using maximum safety settings besides voice settings. Not only that, but I'm scared to go into public worlds because I don't want my custom model stolen that I spent a ridiculous amount of money on, and I constantly hear of horror stories where people get doxxed, their account hacked and all their content deleted, or even people having permanent computer damage because the hacked client someone used was able to modify a person's bios settings and set all their fan speeds to 0. We're at a point where legal action can be taken and damages are becoming real life issues.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
